storage/*
# Pre-built knowledge store for all 6 starter documents is committed on purpose,
# so a fresh clone works without API keys just to browse/evaluate (per the brief's
# "include enough sample output... to evaluate without needing your account").
# New ingests via POST /ingest write into storage/facts/<document_id>.json, which
# stays gitignored (storage/* above already covers it -- no separate rule needed).
!storage/sample_facts.json
!storage/facts_annual_report_fy24.json
!storage/facts_economic_survey.json
!storage/facts_rbi_annual_report.json
!storage/facts_imf_article_iv.json
!storage/fact_embeddings.json
!storage/relationships.db

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

.venv/
venv/

*.key
*.pem
*credential*
*secret*

.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/

VIDEO_SCRIPT.md
